WEBVTT

00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:07,940
Okay back to Minnesota, that's where I practiced now, that's where I was born and raised, started

00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:13,860
up practice again, and started doing chiropractic again, and just studying to write, actually

00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:17,900
had the right machine that I wanted picked out and everything that I wanted, I just did

00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:23,140
not have permission to buy it at that time, there were a lot more expensive than they are

00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,140
now.

00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:28,860
And then a patient came to me, I had a very busy practice, she was just terrified, she was,

00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:33,260
I got to talk to you right now, okay, brought her in the room, she was, I have breast cancer,

00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:37,660
it's the most aggressive kind that you can get, it's in both breasts and they said if I don't

00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:43,300
do chemo and radiation, I'll be dead in three months, and I said, you're telling me this,

00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,300
why?

00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:47,900
And she said, because I don't know who else to go to, and she goes, you don't know this,

00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:54,180
but my friend died of the chemo five months ago, I nursed her through it and it was the

00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:57,940
worst thing I've ever seen in my life, I'm not doing it, so if you can't help me, I'd rather

00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:59,260
die.

00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:04,380
And I just knew, right then, you know, I don't hear the voice of God, audibly, very often,

00:01:04,380 --> 00:01:13,060
that I admit to, but I just knew right then that I was, it's like, you're buying a rife,

00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:16,740
I just said, char, I'm buying a rife, I know you have no idea what that is, you're just

00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:20,980
going to go with me on this, and I need to come down three times a week and we're going

00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:25,940
to do this on you, she lived an hour and a half for my office, she gave down three times

00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:30,740
a week, that was 13 years ago March, she's still alive today.

00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:35,460
And it was because of the rife, and when I, little I do, I do a lot about nutrition compared

00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:40,580
to other doctors, but about cancer, I didn't know a lot about cancer at all, and then eventually

00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:45,140
God said to us, another cancer patient, another cancer patient, literally, you know, five

00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:48,500
years later, no, we're getting like two or three cancer patients, it wasn't, it was just

00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:53,500
kind of a trickle, because God knew that I would have probably ran the other way, and then

00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:57,460
I finally thought, oh my gosh, what if I'm doing something wrong, you know, so I went

00:01:57,460 --> 00:02:02,580
back to school, got an AMA fellowship in functional medicine and integrative cancer therapy,

00:02:02,580 --> 00:02:04,580
and that's the majority of what we do know.

